      "widgets_values": [
        "# markdkberry.com\n\nThe 2 sampler pass suggestions came from \n`u\\Major_Specific_23` on reddit\n https://www.reddit.com/r/StableDiffusion/comments/1p80j9x/comment/nr1jak5/?utm_source=share&utm_medium=web3x&utm_name=web3xcss&utm_term=1&utm_content=share_button\n\nI've used this before in WAN 2.2 models but struggled to stop the tiling effect. It seems to disappear at x6 (I was using x2) and with the settings used here.\n\n---\n\n- I am not certain the negative prompt is working but keep trying. "
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
