          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "doing 2 sampler pass with x6 latent space upscale gives a much more realistic end result in good time.\n\n- for 16:9\n\n- use 288 x 160 will get you x6 latent upscale a good 1728 x 960. finishes in < 1 min. denoise usually at 0.9.\n\n- max bump up (but I dont think its better) go to 512 x 288 and x 4 latent upscale (going to x6 created weird extended results with crisp look, but was over model limits) - this is done in 100 seconds but may need to lower denoise to 0.7"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
