      "widgets_values": [
        "Internal circular command centre atop of a space ship with five crew members (x1 white male, x1 Indian male, x1 Chinese female, x1 black male, x1 european female)  in various positions spread around the cabin, all looking at dials or monitors while sat at their seats. Wearing matching uniforms. hatch lid centre of floor.\n\nThe captain is centrally seated on a slightly raised centrally positioned deck. All are facing away from the centre and out of a large window into space, windows are black with no reflections.\n\nDim lighting with 60 percent monochromatic red color dominance, warm tungsten key light, soft ambient fill.\n\n1970s retro analog science fiction aesthetic, practical film set construction, tactile materials, brushed metal, matte painted surfaces, physical buttons and switches.\n\nShot on 35mm film, subtle film grain, soft highlight bloom, low contrast film stock, muted blacks, warm color cast, slight lens softness, subtle film grain, cinematic realism, gentle halation around lights."
